 crease toward the skin around it, so the texture stays."],["Concealer","Dark spots, eye bags and tear troughs evened out by dodge and burn."],["Matte","Turns shine down across three bands of detail, so pores survive."],["Texture","Paints fine pore grain back over skin that was smoothed."],["Details","Sharpens face, body and background by their own amounts."],["Eyes","Whites, irises, dark circles, red-eye, iris size and colour. Closed eyes are left alone."],["Teeth","Whiten, lift stains, and align the teeth's edge onto a smooth curve."],["Skin","Tone from Fair to Deep or any colour, redness, and tan, sun-kissed or glass-skin looks."],["Fillers","Fills hollows at the temples, cheeks and eyes with light, and plumps the lips."],["Age","One slider moves 18 signs of age, each arriving at its own point, down to grey hair strand by strand."],["Sculpt","50 face controls in seven tabs. Neighbouring features stay put and the outline never tears."],["Reshape","Push, resize and restore, plus Protect, which holds against every warp."],["Body","Slim, waist, hips, legs and posture, while arms and hands keep their shape."],["Makeup","Lips in nine finishes, eyeshadow, liner, lashes, brows, blush, contour and freckles, plus saved looks."],["Hair","17 shades laid along the hair's own light and matted strand by strand. Shine, smooth and volume."],["Relight","Studio, neon, rim and scene lights that wrap around the face's 3D form."],["Background","Shaped bokeh, colour or photo swaps, shadow and blend, with a cut-out that follows the hair."],["Presets","One tap sets a filter, a little retouching and the background together."],["Filters","85 colour filters in twelve groups, from film stocks to light leaks, kept off faces."],["Glitter","Brush-on glitter in nine colours, and star glints on the photo's own highlights."],["Adjust","Seventeen light, colour and detail controls, plus Auto."],["Crop","Ratios, rotation, straightening, perspective and lens correction."],["Text","Nine templates, seven fonts and five styles, neon included."]],"loc":13703,"sculpt":50}